OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of light rain at first
OL,7,Fbecoming drier overnight for most
OL,8,Fexcept for some patchy rain over high
OL,9,Fground in the west. Becoming
OL,10,Fincreasingly windy along the coast.
OL,11,FFeeling cold, with frost forming.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA grey and wet start to the
OL,14,Fweekend, with outbreaks of heavy rain
OL,15,Fpossible throughout the day, only
OL,16,Fstarting to clear by the evening.
OL,17,FStrong winds, especially along the
OL,18,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
