OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FClear
OL,6,Fstart to Sunday, blustery showers
OL,7,Fdeveloping later. Cloudy periods and
OL,8,Fwindy on Monday, with rain across
OL,9,FYorkshire Dales. Grey and wet on
OL,10,FTuesday. Turning noticeably milder
OL,11,Ffrom Monday onwards.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
